{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">AbstractPunk Demo is the demo version of a wild, punk, trippy soulslike game with unique collage-style graphics. Collect ice from defeated enemies, fight your way through a revolution-ridden country, and try to find your place in the broken, twisted reality of 2004.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use luck against your enemies. They will be happy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>In the demo, players can explore the first area of the AbstractPunk world \u2014 the office, the housing block, and the city await!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">AbstractPunk is a unique first-person game that\u2019s a chaotic blend of soulslike, boomer FPS, 3D platformer, RPG, and roguelike. Immerse yourself in a world of collage chaos and cut-out abstract art, all backed by an original soundtrack filled with energetic, catchy tunes and punk spirit.<br><br>AbstractPunk is not just a game \u2014 it\u2019s a bold, gripping journey that breaks expectations, offering an emotional, visually explosive adventure. Get ready for intense battles, thrilling exploration, and a rush that keeps you coming back for more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>AbstractPunk Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Radical gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No forgiveness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect ice</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Level up</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tear through the totalitarian world of 2004</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Never give up</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect faces</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fall and rise</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shoot with luck</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Go to the Ice Queen's Palace</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Decide the fate of the world</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rich, unique soundtrack:</strong><br>Punk, post-punk, electro-punk, synth-punk, electroclash and more<br>Songs!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3744620?t=1748733089","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3744620?t=1748733089","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744620/18f8ce61781015facdd6579d80210e73f44b75b7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748733089","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744620/18f8ce61781015facdd6579d80210e73f44b75b7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748733089","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">AbstractPunk Demo is the demo version of a wild, punk, trippy soulslike game with unique collage-style graphics. Collect ice from defeated enemies, fight your way through a revolution-ridden country, and try to find your place in the broken, twisted reality of 2004.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use luck against your enemies. They will be happy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>In the demo, players can explore the first area of the AbstractPunk world \u2014 the office, the housing block, and the city await!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">AbstractPunk is a unique first-person game that\u2019s a chaotic blend of soulslike, boomer FPS, 3D platformer, RPG, and roguelike. Immerse yourself in a world of collage chaos and cut-out abstract art, all backed by an original soundtrack filled with energetic, catchy tunes and punk spirit.<br><br>AbstractPunk is not just a game \u2014 it\u2019s a bold, gripping journey that breaks expectations, offering an emotional, visually explosive adventure. Get ready for intense battles, thrilling exploration, and a rush that keeps you coming back for more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>AbstractPun